  "system": {
    "identifier": "shadowed-shot",
    "description": "<p>You throw your weapon as if it was a single shot, but in its shadow hides another. Select a creature in range and make a ranged Taijutsu Attack, dealing your [Weapons damage] on a hit.</p>\n<p>The target creature must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure they fail to see the second attack hiding in the shadow of the first, taking your [Weapons damage] or no additional damage on a success.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Creatures who fail their saving throw gain a rank of Bleeding.       At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
